---
# Asio's Windows thread and resolver implementations (win_thread.ipp, resolver_thread_pool.ipp)
# trip these path-sensitive checks; the reports sit in Asio's headers but are reached from this
# directory, so the header filter cannot drop them. Only this directory includes Asio.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -clang-analyzer-cplusplus.NewDelete,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.cplusplus.VirtualCall
